  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-3.char": "I came here in peace, to learn. I have not antagonized you, nor threatened you. I even offered to help you.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-3.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-4.char": "You have allies here, I've met them, they want to help. But you choose isolation, you choose to be an enemy.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-4.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-5.ancient": "I chose to be left alone, but you have done a fine job ensuring that my choices don't matter.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-5.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-6.char": "You know...this book has been a fun read. An artificial heart to support the life of an ancient tree.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-6.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-7.ancient": "What are you getting at?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-7.next": "Ignore Him",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-8.char": "A Blight so potent it rippled through it roots, salting the land from the inside out.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-8.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-9.ancient": "Don't you dare-",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-9.next": "Ponder Aloud",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-10.char": "I wonder what else such a potent creation could manage? I wonder if this spire would be able to survive it?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-10.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-11.ancient": "Give me that book!",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.DICETHESPIRE-THE_INVENTOR.2-11.next": "Denied",
